<!--
  BRAND.md §1 — the crescent-S. Two offset crescent arcs meeting at the centre of the grid,
  their union reading as the letter S.

  Stroked rather than filled, with round caps: the caps are what make each arc terminate as a
  crescent horn instead of a cut-off band, and a stroke keeps the mark one continuous shape
  with no internal detail, which is what has to survive at 24px.

  The path given in BRAND.md §1 encloses no area and renders blank. Its two arcs are 50 apart
  with radii 25 and 18; the SVG spec scales an undersized radius up to fit, so the second arc
  becomes an identical semicircle to the first and the outline retraces itself. This geometry
  replaces it — the same mark as described, drawn so that it exists.

  Every extent sits inside the 66dp safe circle: the arcs span y 22..86 and x 35..73 on the
  108 grid, against a safe band of 21..87.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <path
        android:pathData="M66.22,36.55 A13,13 0 1,0 54,54 A13,13 0 1,1 41.78,71.45"
        android:strokeColor="#3A2E12"
        android:strokeWidth="12"
        android:strokeLineCap="round" />
</vector>
